server_unreachable.description:
spdbf Public Transport hasn't had a working departure board from DBF at {server} since {since} ({reason}). It checks every minute.

{fallback}

If DBF itself is unreachable, check that the db-fakedisplay container is running. If DBF answers with errors, DB's or a transport company's systems are failing, and there's nothing to fix on your side. This notice disappears by itself once DBF delivers again.
